    ('en_US',  'LOC_DIPLOMACY_PROJECT_MILITARY_AID_DESCRIPTION',   'Gives a bonus towards producing Military Units.[n]Accepted: Your [icon:YIELD_CITIES] Cities gain +10% Production towards roducing Military Units. Other Leader receives +2[icon:YIELD_GOLD] Gold per turn.[n]Supported: Both Leaders [icon:YIELD_CITIES] Cities gain +15% Production towards roducing Military Units'),
    ('en_US',  'LOC_DIPLOMACY_PROJECT_MILITARY_AID_SUPPORT',   'Both Leaders [icon:YIELD_CITIES] Cities gain +10% Production towards roducing Military Units'),

